---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About — HUE Co." description="HUE Co. began with a single belief: that permanent jewelry shouldn't feel like a commitment — it should feel like freedom. Located in Santa Cruz, CA.">

<!-- ── Hero ──────────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
<section class="section--dark about-hero">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="about-hero__inner">
      <div class="about-hero__text">
        <span class="eyebrow eyebrow--light">Our Story</span>
        <h1 class="section-title section-title--xl about-hero__title">The Art of HUE</h1>
        <p class="about-hero__lead">HUE Co. began with a single belief: that permanent jewelry shouldn't feel like a commitment — it should feel like freedom. No clasp to fidget with. No fear of losing it. Just you, adorned.</p>
        <p class="about-hero__body">We opened our doors in Santa Cruz with a small table, a micro-welding tool, and the conviction that the ritual of jewelry — the choosing, the wearing, the meaning — deserved a better home than a department store counter. Every piece we weld is sized to your exact body. Every appointment is unhurried. Every decision is yours.</p>
        <a href="/book" class="btn btn--outline about-hero__cta">Book an Appointment</a>
      </div>
      <div class="about-hero__photo">
        <div class="photo-block photo-block--portrait photo-block--warm"></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ── The Studio ─────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
<section class="section section--cream">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="studio-layout">
      <div class="studio-photo">
        <div class="photo-block photo-block--landscape photo-block--warm"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="studio-text">
        <span class="eyebrow eyebrow--dark">Santa Cruz, CA</span>
        <h2 class="section-title">A studio built for the experience</h2>
        <div class="rule"></div>
        <p class="studio-body">Located in the heart of Santa Cruz, our studio is designed to feel like a boutique, not a salon. Every appointment is private. Every weld is personal. Walk in. Walk out wearing something that's yours forever.</p>
        <p class="studio-body">We keep our space intentionally intimate — no crowds, no waiting rooms, no noise. When you sit down at our table, the hour is yours. We've had clients come in on their lunch break, on their wedding morning, on the day they got the news. Permanent jewelry finds its moment.</p>
        <div class="studio-details">
          <div class="studio-detail">
            <span class="studio-detail__label">Hours</span>
            <span class="studio-detail__value">Tuesday – Saturday &middot; 10am – 7pm</span>
          </div>
          <div class="studio-detail">
            <span class="studio-detail__label">Location</span>
            <span class="studio-detail__value">Santa Cruz, CA &middot; @hueco.studio for address</span>
          </div>
          <div class="studio-detail">
            <span class="studio-detail__label">Parking</span>
            <span class="studio-detail__value">Free street parking available</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ── The Process ────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
<section class="section section--dark">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header">
      <span class="eyebrow eyebrow--light">What Happens</span>
      <h2 class="section-title">The Process</h2>
      <p class="section-subtitle">Three steps. Thirty minutes. Something permanent.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="process-steps">
      <div class="process-step">
        <div class="process-step__number">01</div>
        <div class="process-step__content">
          <h3 class="process-step__title">You Choose</h3>
          <p class="process-step__desc">We lay out physical chain samples — every style, every width, every metal tier. You feel them, hold them against your skin, ask every question. Your welder walks you through options without pressure. When you've decided, we measure to your exact body.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="process-step">
        <div class="process-step__number">02</div>
        <div class="process-step__content">
          <h3 class="process-step__title">We Weld</h3>
          <p class="process-step__desc">A ten-second micro-weld closes the chain. The same technology jewelers use to size rings — precise, controlled, safe. No heat touches your skin. No pain. Just a small spark and the quiet satisfaction of watching something become permanent.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="process-step">
        <div class="process-step__number">03</div>
        <div class="process-step__content">
          <h3 class="process-step__title">You Leave</h3>
          <p class="process-step__desc">Wearing something permanent. You walk out the same person, just more adorned. Your weld comes with a 30-day warranty — if anything comes undone in that window, we re-weld for free. And removal is always free, any time, no questions asked.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ── Values ─────────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
<section class="section section--cream">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header section-header--center">
      <span class="eyebrow eyebrow--dark">What We Believe</span>
      <h2 class="section-title">The Values of HUE</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="values-grid">
      <div class="value-block">
        <h3 class="value-block__title">Permanence</h3>
        <div class="rule"></div>
        <p class="value-block__text">We believe permanent things should be worth keeping. Every weld is done with intention. We don't rush consultations. We don't oversell. When the weld closes, it should feel exactly right.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="value-block">
        <h3 class="value-block__title">Precision</h3>
        <div class="rule"></div>
        <p class="value-block__text">Chain lengths measured to your body. Not "small, medium, large." Your exact wrist. Your exact ankle. The piece should feel like it grew there — because in a very real sense, it now has.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="value-block">
        <h3 class="value-block__title">Access</h3>
        <div class="rule"></div>
        <p class="value-block__text">Three tiers because permanence should be accessible. The ritual is the same whether you choose Tier 1 or Tier 3. The consultation is the same. The care is the same. From $42. Always.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ── Book CTA ───────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
<section class="section--butter section--sm">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="about-cta">
      <h2 class="section-title">Ready to be permanently adorned?</h2>
      <a href="/book" class="btn btn--outline-dark">Book Your Weld</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

</Layout>

<style is:global>
/* ── About Hero ────────────────────────────────────────────── */
.about-hero {
  padding-top: calc(var(--nav-height) + 80px);
  padding-bottom: 120px;
}

.about-hero__inner {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr 440px;
  gap: 80px;
  align-items: center;
}

.about-hero__title {
  margin-top: 8px;
  margin-bottom: 28px;
}

.about-hero__lead {
  font-family: var(--font-display);
  font-size: clamp(1.1rem, 2vw, 1.4rem);
  font-weight: 300;
  font-style: italic;
  line-height: 1.6;
  opacity: 0.85;
  margin-bottom: 20px;
  max-width: 52ch;
}

.about-hero__body {
  font-family: var(--font-body);
  font-size: 15px;
  font-weight: 300;
  line-height: 1.85;
  opacity: 0.65;
  max-width: 52ch;
  margin-bottom: 40px;
}

.about-hero__cta {
  margin-top: 8px;
}

/* ── Studio Section ─────────────────────────────────────────── */
.studio-layout {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
  gap: 80px;
  align-items: center;
}

.studio-body {
  font-family: var(--font-body);
  font-size: 15px;
  font-weight: 300;
  line-height: 1.85;
  opacity: 0.72;
  margin-bottom: 20px;
  max-width: 52ch;
}

.studio-details {
  margin-top: 40px;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 0;
  border-top: 1px solid var(--cream-dark);
}

.studio-detail {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  align-items: center;
  padding: 14px 0;
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--cream-dark);
}

.studio-detail__label {
  font-family: var(--font-body);
  font-size: 10px;
  font-weight: 500;
  letter-spacing: 0.14em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  opacity: 0.45;
}

.studio-detail__value {
  font-family: var(--font-body);
  font-size: 13px;
  font-weight: 300;
  opacity: 0.8;
  text-align: right;
}

/* ── Process ────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
.process-steps {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
  gap: 48px;
}

.process-step__number {
  font-family: var(--font-display);
  font-size: clamp(4rem, 8vw, 7rem);
  font-weight: 300;
  line-height: 1;
  color: rgba(212, 185, 106, 0.15);
  margin-bottom: 16px;
}

.process-step__title {
  font-family: var(--font-display);
  font-size: 1.6rem;
  font-weight: 400;
  color: var(--warm-white);
  margin-bottom: 16px;
}

.process-step__desc {
  font-family: var(--font-body);
  font-size: 14px;
  font-weight: 300;
  line-height: 1.85;
  opacity: 0.62;
}

/* ── Values ─────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
.values-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
  gap: 48px;
}

.value-block__title {
  font-family: var(--font-display);
  font-size: 2rem;
  font-weight: 400;
  color: var(--black);
  margin-bottom: 8px;
}

.value-block__text {
  font-family: var(--font-body);
  font-size: 14px;
  font-weight: 300;
  line-height: 1.85;
  opacity: 0.68;
}

/* ── Book CTA ───────────────────────────────────────────────── */
.about-cta {
  text-align: center;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 32px;
}

/* ── Responsive ─────────────────────────────────────────────── */
@media (max-width: 1024px) {
  .about-hero__inner {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 48px;
  }

  .about-hero__photo {
    order: -1;
    max-width: 480px;
  }

  .studio-layout {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 48px;
  }

  .process-steps {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 40px;
  }

  .values-grid {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 40px;
  }
}

@media (max-width: 768px) {
  .studio-detail {
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 4px;
  }

  .studio-detail__value {
    text-align: left;
  }
}
</style>
